# Local-only artifacts that must never be part of a deploy upload.
# .gitignore alone isn't reliably honored by `vercel deploy`'s file walk —
# be explicit here too (found 2026-07-19: a stray 9.8GB local Postgres dump
# at repo root inflated a plain `vercel deploy` to a 10GB payload and it
# failed with EPIPE).
*.pgdump
*.pgdump.gz
.claude/
.claude-worktrees/
.playwright-mcp/
.playwright-cli/
.lighthouseci/
.keystone-canvas-refs/
.polis-redesign-screens/
node_modules/
.git/
.next/
coverage/
.jscpd-report/
